{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "למדתי אתכם", :translit "limad'ti et'chem", :gloss "I have taught you"} {:he "בחנם", :translit "bechinam", :gloss "freely"} {:he "ט\"ו פעמים", :translit "tet-vav pe'amim", :gloss "fifteen times"} {:he "לימוד", :translit "limud", :gloss "teaching"} {:he "במשנה תורה", :translit "be'mishneh torah", :gloss "in Deuteronomy"} {:he "רמז בן ט\"ו לגמרא", :translit "remez ben tet-vav la'gemara", :gloss "allusion to the fifteen of the Gemara"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 15, :occurrences ["לימוד"]} {:kind :other, :note "Fifteen occurrences of לימוד allude to the fifteen treatises of the Gemara"}], :frame {:text "The number fifteen is structurally associated with the Song of the Sea, which the Torah explicitly calls a 'shirah' (Exodus 15:1), and this song is said to contain fifteen expressions of praise corresponding to fifteen concepts. Ba'al HaTurim elsewhere links the fifteen Songs of Ascents in Psalms (Psalms 120–134) to fifteen steps in the Temple.", :sources ["Exodus 15:1" "Psalms 120–134"]}} {:quotes [{:he "באים שמה לרשתה ושמרתם", :translit "ba'im shamah lerishtah ush'martem", :gloss "you come there to possess it and you shall keep"} {:he "כדכתיב", :translit "kad'katuv", :gloss "as written"} {:he "ויתן להם ארצות גוים בעבור ישמרו חקיו", :translit "veyitein lahem aratzot goyim ba'avur yishmeru chukav", :gloss "and He gave them lands of nations in order that they keep His statutes"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "Word-linkage (gezeirah shavah) between 'לרשתה' / 'ושמרתם' in our verse and 'ארצות גוים' / 'ישמרו חקיו' in Psalms 105:44-45"}], :frame {:text "The prooftext from Psalms 105:44-45 states that God gave Israel 'lands of nations' (ארצות גוים) so that they would 'keep His statutes' (ישמרו חקיו). Ba'al HaTurim links this to Deuteronomy 4:5, where Moses says 'you come there to possess it (לרשתה) and you shall keep (ושמרתם),' showing that territorial inheritance and observance are bound together in both verses.", :sources ["Psalms 105:44-45" "Deuteronomy 4:5"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :masorah, :count 15, :occurrences ["לימוד"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "לימוד", :refs ["Deuteronomy 17:19" "Deuteronomy 20:18" "Deuteronomy 31:12" "Deuteronomy 31:13" "Judges 3:16" "1 Samuel 17:39" "Isaiah 1:17" "Isaiah 2:4"], :n 30, :lens :plene-insensitive}]} {:kind :other, :note "Fifteen occurrences of לימוד allude to the fifteen treatises of the Gemara", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :other, :note "Word-linkage (gezeirah shavah) between 'לרשתה' / 'ושמרתם' in our verse and 'ארצות גוים' / 'ישמרו חקיו' in Psalms 105:44-45", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:33:55.499386200Z", :model "glm-5.2"}